*Heading
Per-element fibre angles given by a *Distribution (variable-angle-tow style), C3D8 plate
** 6 x 2 x 1 C3D8 bricks (1 x 1 x 0.5), orthotropic CFRP, two instances of one part: the
** second is translated and rotated 30 deg about an inclined axis.  Each element has its own
** in-plane fibre angle (0 .. 75 deg).  The *Distribution lists elements 1-8 one by one,
** 9-10 through an element set, and leaves 11-12 to its default line; the *Orientation adds
** an extra 10 deg about local 3.  validate_with_ccx.py checks that every node moves exactly
** as in distribution_solid_plate_explicit.inp, the same model written with one
** *Orientation and one *Solid Section per element.
